---
Print a completion script for your shell.

Usage: ink completions <SHELL>

Examples
  # Print the bash script; see `ink help completions`
  ink completions bash

  # Print the nushell script
  ink completions nushell

Arguments
  <SHELL>  The shell to print the script for

Exit codes
  0  Done; warnings, if any, were printed
  1  The site has errors
  2  Wrong usage, or a folder that is missing; nothing was
     changed

Docs    https://github.com/uses-ink/uses.ink/blob/main/docs/cli.md
Global  -C, --json, -q, -v, --color, --no-progress, --log,
        --log-file (see `ink --help`)
